  {
    "id": "sitl28-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "SITL 11 Param read by index",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Collect the ArduPilot param list, pick LOIT_SPEED_MS by index, then PARAM_REQUEST_READ with param_index ≥ 0 and empty param_id.",
    "env": []
  },
  {
    "id": "sitl28-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "sitl28-tab",
    "name": "Read by param_index after list collect",
    "info": "1. request-list + collect → full PARAM_VALUE table.\n2. Function finds LOIT_SPEED_MS (safe on Copter 4.7.0; no WPNAV_SPEED) and sets msg.payload.paramIndex.\n3. Read (send) emits PARAM_REQUEST_READ; assert function checks param_index ≥ 0 and empty param_id.\n\nConnection: AP bind 0.0.0.0:14550 → 127.0.0.1:14551 sysid 1.",
    "x": 280,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
